諾。」當是時，項王軍在鴻門下，沛公軍在霸上，相去四十里。沛公則置車騎，脫身獨騎，與樊噲、夏侯嬰、靳彊、紀信等四人持劍盾步走，從酈山下，道芷陽閒行。沛公謂張良曰：「從此道至吾軍，不過二十里耳。度我至軍中，公乃入。」沛公已去，閒至軍中，張良入謝，曰：「沛公不勝桮杓，不能辭。謹使臣良奉白璧一雙，再拜獻大王足下；玉斗一雙，再拜奉大將軍足下。」項王曰：「沛公安在？」良曰：「聞大王有意督過之，脫身獨去，已至軍矣。」項王則受璧，置之坐上。亞父受玉斗，置之地，拔劍撞而破之，曰：「唉！豎子不足與謀。奪項王天下者，必沛公也，吾屬今為之虜矣。」沛公至軍，立誅殺曹無傷。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m019-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m019-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m019-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"陳平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m019-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m019-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"沛公","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m019-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"樊噲","kind":"person","person_id":"b1r_inb_fts","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m019-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"張良","kind":"person","person_id":"ea5_zvr_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m019-0084","start":84,"end":85,"surface":"良","kind":"person","person_id":"ea5_zvr_hlp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m019-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"大王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m019-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m019-0118","start":118,"end":120,"surface":"亞父","kind":"person","person_